    "name": "Bottom-Up Beatdown: Hostile Takeover",
    "steam_appid": 3822860,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For modern-day monsters, world domination no longer comes through sheer power; you need brains, wit, and a ton of capital. The lazy shark-man Biff Steaks has none of that, nor the desire to take over the world, yet one horrible day leads him to become a key target in an ongoing battle between warring conglomerates! If he ever wants his normal life back, he'll have to take it to the top!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822860/extras/dbb19a98a3e335431d246f2296bac0af.poster.avif?t=1752104913\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822860/extras/dbb19a98a3e335431d246f2296bac0af.gif?t=1752104913\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through armies of goons and unique bosses in a variety of levels! Bottom-Up Beatdown: Hostile Takeover combines the chaos of classic 2D beat em' ups with the freeform combat systems of character action games. Battle through unique environments led by their distinct bosses!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822860/extras/2d53f696b588f0544e555d3e47fb8a1c.poster.avif?t=1752104913\" width=800 height=116 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822860/extras/2d53f696b588f0544e555d3e47fb8a1c.webm?t=1752104913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822860/extras/2d53f696b588f0544e555d3e47fb8a1c.mp4?t=1752104913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready for some overtime?\u00a0Play co-op and enjoy some quality bonding time shooting for high scores in multiple arenas or go for the best time in boss rush mode! Select from a pool of eccentric characters!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822860/extras/c28c59d593402b8331b1c91f41583ce9.poster.avif?t=1752104913\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822860/extras/c28c59d593402b8331b1c91f41583ce9.gif?t=1752104913\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In order to escape this corporate conspiracy, you'll have to make some allies and enemies along the way. You'll have to work with Sue Flay, a mysterious agent of Mask Corporation, who guarantees your freedom once you take down their rivals at the Third Eye Network. It's all uphill from here...</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For modern-day monsters, world domination no longer comes through sheer power; you need brains, wit, and a ton of capital. The lazy shark-man Biff Steaks has none of that, nor the desire to take over the world, yet one horrible day leads him to become a key target in an ongoing battle between warring conglomerates! If he ever wants his normal life back, he'll have to take it to the top!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822860/extras/dbb19a98a3e335431d246f2296bac0af.poster.avif?t=1752104913\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822860/extras/dbb19a98a3e335431d246f2296bac0af.gif?t=1752104913\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through armies of goons and unique bosses in a variety of levels! Bottom-Up Beatdown: Hostile Takeover combines the chaos of classic 2D beat em' ups with the freeform combat systems of character action games. Battle through unique environments led by their distinct bosses!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822860/extras/2d53f696b588f0544e555d3e47fb8a1c.poster.avif?t=1752104913\" width=800 height=116 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822860/extras/2d53f696b588f0544e555d3e47fb8a1c.webm?t=1752104913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822860/extras/2d53f696b588f0544e555d3e47fb8a1c.mp4?t=1752104913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready for some overtime?\u00a0Play co-op and enjoy some quality bonding time shooting for high scores in multiple arenas or go for the best time in boss rush mode! Select from a pool of eccentric characters!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822860/extras/c28c59d593402b8331b1c91f41583ce9.poster.avif?t=1752104913\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822860/extras/c28c59d593402b8331b1c91f41583ce9.gif?t=1752104913\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In order to escape this corporate conspiracy, you'll have to make some allies and enemies along the way. You'll have to work with Sue Flay, a mysterious agent of Mask Corporation, who guarantees your freedom once you take down their rivals at the Third Eye Network. It's all uphill from here...</p>",
    "short_description": "Bottom-Up Beatdown: Hostile Takeover is an action-packed 2D beat em' up set in a world dominated by corporations led by monsters! The only way out is up! Become a star solo or share the spotlight with friends in co-op mode!",
